> последний ход.</para
></listitem>
			</varlistentry>
			<varlistentry id="move-menu-redo">
				<term
><menuchoice
><shortcut
><keycombo action="simul"
>&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap
>Z</keycap
></keycombo
></shortcut
> <guimenu
>Ход</guimenu
